    "text": "KVAL\nwebsite\nEugene\nCity of Eugene expands Riverfront Park system with land acquisition\nBy News Staff,\n1 days agoEUGENE, Ore. — The City of Eugene has expanded its park system with the recent acquisition of approximately eight acres of riverfront property adjacent to the Downtown Riverfront Park. The newly acquired site, located along the south bank of the Willamette River, will be managed as a natural area...\n3",
